   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **You Get To Rome**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Yes To Everything**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **All In Your Head**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **No Use Waiting**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Rainbow Power**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Throwback**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **We Ain't Getting Any Younger Pt. 2**: back after 22 archived shows (724 days); rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **It Will Work Out**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2018-11-21._FLAC** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 124 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- David Givan played drums as a guest on part of the show, marked with an asterisk in the notes [1]\n- Alynda Sergarra of Hurray For The Riff Raff guested on vocals, marked with a hash symbol in the notes [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2018-11-21._FLAC**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk41 (DINa/FOB) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony M10 (24/96) [1]",
